as. So after half an hour, 1 changed","y":0.65261627946818479},{"y":0.6671511627623109,"w":0.32510288238525387,"x":0.57407407862904647,"text":"channels and watched something with a better","h":0.011627906839719149},{"h":0.013260996667873726,"x":0.57201646734673128,"y":0.68005295656137366,"text":"acting \/ plot\/ special effects.","w":0.20987653732299805},{"x":0.54938272733211635,"text":"Conversation 4: Jenny and Holly","w":0.23662549972534175,"h":0.01162790683971926,"y":0.70203488369254352},{"text":"J: Let's watch that new 'talent show \/ chat show \/","x":0.54938272031759883,"y":0.71800529546831204,"w":0.34773662567138663,"h":0.011645867144861599},{"y":0.73389232141826244,"x":0.56995885664826051,"w":0.30864196777343744,"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"game show and try to answer the questions."},{"y":0.7470930237087372,"text":"H: I don't watch those kinds of programmes. They're","w":0.36419750213623037,"x":0.54938273264244719,"h":0.013277673763399722},{"w":0.36051620483398439,"x":0.57180152938790985,"text":"too ®addictive \/ engaging \/ moving for me and then","y":0.75849481539631891,"h":0.017729832446375271},{"w":0.17489711761474602,"h":0.010244975969629366,"text":"I need to watch them all.","x":0.56995885151498615,"y":0.77616279094798746},{"w":0.19958847045898442,"h":0.010196227050942808,"text":"Conversation 5: Al and Ben","x":0.54732510966076831,"y":0.7965116282057394},{"w":0.30452672958374027,"x":0.54938272245092845,"h":0.014590047043398835,"y":0.81244483645485832,"text":"A: The 'script \/ setting \/ acting of this film is"},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"Birmingham in the 1960s.","x":0.5658436168949541,"w":0.18312757492065423,"y":0.8283318622537198},{"text":"B: I know. And I read in the newspaper that the","y":0.8428949692044847,"h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.33333332061767584,"x":0.54320988598745823},{"text":"10 script \/ plot \/ soundtrack was written by a real","x":0.567901231828143,"h":0.013268693821259725,"w":0.3292181015014648,"y":0.85610465137346592},{"